# SQLite database files must never be part of the deployment manifest:
# they are regenerated by `postbuild` (db:setup) during the build and their
# WAL sidecars (-wal/-shm) get deleted when the build process closes the
# database, which previously crashed "Deploying outputs..." with ENOENT.
data/

# Local/dev-only files
.kilo/
*.tsbuildinfo
